{
 "comment": "Same plugin-panel pattern as the mopho/tg55 layouts. Rows follow the ESQ-1 voice path printed on its panel: OSC 1-3 -> DCA 1-3 -> FILTER -> DCA 4 (always ENV 4) -> pan, then the modulators (ENV 1-4, LFO 1-3), then MODES and SPLIT/LAYER. OSC and DCA groups share one select {o} (select.shared = 'osc'), the two envelope groups share {e} ('env'), 'all' writes every copy. Envelopes are time/level (T1 L1 T2 L2 T3 L3 T4), not ADSR, so they are plain knobs in segment order rather than an env cell. Mod source cells are picks (16 sources: LFO1-3, ENV1-4, VEL, VEL2, KYBD, KYBD2, WHEEL, PEDAL, XCTRL, PRESS, OFF). The name is edited in the name field (name1-6 ascii params).",
